        "runId": "submit-9e9cff89-eaf8-4da3-b719-163cca50324d-10",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Spend the day at your leisure after New Year’s Eve.\n\nIn the evening, you can dine at **Cipriani**, the Michelin-starred restaurant at Belmond Copacabana Palace. You can also book optional excursions for this day."
